

### Get auth token for admin
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin"
}

### Get auth token for user
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "kate1997",
  "password": "Kate1997!"
}

### Positive test Admin can create new user with correct data
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/admin/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=

{
  "username": "kate1997",
  "password": "Kate1997!",
  "role": "USER"
}

### Negative test Admin cannot create new user with blank username
< {%
    // Простейший генератор пароля: Большая + маленькая + цифра + спецсимвол + рандом
    var password = "Safe123!" + Math.random().toString(36).substring(2, 7);
    client.global.set("my_pass", password);
%}
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/admin/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=

{
  "username": "",
  "password": "{{my_pass}}",
  "role": "USER"
}

### Posivite test Authorized user can create account
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic a2F0ZTE5OTk6S2F0ZTE5OTkh

### Posivite test Account was created
GET http://localhost:4111/api/v1/customer/accounts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic a2F0ZTE5OTk6S2F0ZTE5OTkh
